                    General, 3/22/63-3/31/63. Secret.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d268-f2" n="1" xml:id="d268-f2-content">
                <p>The query was expressed in NSAM No. 223, <ref
                        target="#d260">Document 260</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d268-f3" n="2" xml:id="d268-f3-content">
                <p>Not attached. Dated March 22 and March 21, respectively. (Department of State,
                    Central Files, POL 27 CHICOM-INDIA)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
